    "title": "Lufthansa Cargo pauses all-cargo flights to Mumbai over congestion - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Eric Kulisch ,\n1 days ago Lufthansa Cargo has temporarily suspended freighter services to Mumbai International Airport in India and logistics companies are alerting customers to expect long shipping delays because of congestion. The cargo airline subsidiary of Lufthansa Group (XETRA: LHA) paused flights to Mumbai from Sept. 20 until the end of the month because... Read full article",
